MODULE: LeaseNeverSettles
TARGET: LeaseSettles
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a completed exchange never finishes its lease cycle
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
    /\ phase' = [phase EXCEPT ![s] = "idle"]
    /\ age' = [age EXCEPT ![s] = 0]
--- REPLACE
    /\ phase' = phase
    /\ age' = [age EXCEPT ![s] = 0]
--- END
